  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manaaki New Zealand Scholarships Programme Operational Management: July 2024 - June 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity, following on from the Scholarships Improvement Project and previous phases of outsourcing, aims to have the operational management of the Manaaki New Zealand Scholarships Programme delivered by Education New Zealand with continuous improvement from July 2024 until June 2027.</narrative>
  </description>
